     "prompt": "Pixel art ICON SHEET of 31 square ability icons for a dark fantasy monster-evolution game. Layout: a grid of exactly 6 rows and 6 columns of equal square icons read left to right, top to bottom, a clear empty gap of background between icons, no grid lines; the last 5 cells stay completely empty. Every icon: a dark violet square tile with a subtle inner glow and a 2-pixel bevelled frame, holding ONE bold symbolic image of the skill that reads at a tiny size, in that skill's dominant colour. All icons share one consistent style and frame. Cell 1 (row 1, column 1) = \"Pounce\": Leap forward, biting everything in your path; dominant colour red (#ff5a4a). Cell 2 (row 1, column 2) = \"Blood Frenzy\": Bite faster and harder, healing from every wound; dominant colour red (#ff2a2a). Cell 3 (row 1, column 3) = \"Rend\": Claw everything around you, causing bleeding; dominant colour red (#c41a1a). Cell 4 (row 1, column 4) = \"Savage Roar\": Terrify nearby creatures so they flee from you; dominant colour orange (#ffa04a). Cell 5 (row 1, column 5) = \"Devour\": A colossal bite around you that heals for half the damage; dominant colour red (#ff0030). Cell 6 (row 1, column 6) = \"Fire Breath\": Breathe a cone of fire that burns; dominant colour orange (#ff8a1a). Cell 7 (row 2, column 1) = \"Dragon Dive\": Dive forward and explode in flame on landing; dominant colour orange (#ff6a1a). Cell 8 (row 2, column 2) = \"Inferno\": Engulf the area in a sea of fire; dominant colour amber (#ffd21a). Cell 9 (row 2, column 3) = \"Harden\": Turn to stone, greatly reducing damage taken; dominant colour amber (#c49a5a). Cell 10 (row 2, column 4) = \"Quake\": Slam the ground, damaging and stunning nearby enemies; dominant colour amber (#a07a3a). Cell 11 (row 2, column 5) = \"Boulder Toss\": Hurl a huge boulder that crushes through enemies; dominant colour grey (#8a7a6a). Cell 12 (row 2, column 6) = \"Spike Armor\": Harden and reflect damage back to attackers; dominant colour orange (#e0b070). Cell 13 (row 3, column 1) = \"Rampage\": Charge a long distance, trampling and knocking enemies away; dominant colour orange (#ff7a4a). Cell 14 (row 3, column 2) = \"Meteor Slam\": Leap and crash down like a falling mountain; dominant colour orange (#ff9a2a). Cell 15 (row 3, column 3) = \"Venom Spit\": Spit a glob of poison; dominant colour lime (#7ccf3a). Cell 16 (row 3, column 4) = \"Many-Headed Spit\": Every head spits venom at once; dominant colour lime (#a0ff3a). Cell 17 (row 3, column 5) = \"Toxic Cloud\": Leave a lingering cloud of poison; dominant colour lime (#6aaf2a). Cell 18 (row 3, column 6) = \"Acid Burst\": Burst acid all around, poisoning everything; dominant colour lime (#c4ff3a). Cell 19 (row 4, column 1) = \"Plague Nova\": Release every plague at once; dominant colour purple (#d04aff). Cell 20 (row 4, column 2) = \"Web Shot\": Shoot sticky web that pierces and slows; dominant colour light yellow (#e8e8d0). Cell 21 (row 4, column 3) = \"Brood\": Hatch spiderlings that fight for you; dominant colour lime (#9aff4a). Cell 22 (row 4, column 4) = \"Hive Call\": Call a swarm of your children to war; dominant colour teal (#3affc0). Cell 23 (row 4, column 5) = \"Arcane Bolt\": A homing bolt of pure magic; dominant colour blue (#5aa8ff). Cell 24 (row 4, column 6) = \"Blink\": Teleport forward, leaving a burst of magic; dominant colour light cyan (#a0f0ff). Cell 25 (row 5, column 1) = \"Mana Nova\": Explode with mana, hurling enemies away; dominant colour light teal (#7affff). Cell 26 (row 5, column 2) = \"Gravity Well\": Create a well that pulls enemies in and crushes them; dominant colour light indigo (#c07aff). Cell 27 (row 5, column 3) = \"Starfall\": Call down a rain of falling stars; dominant colour light amber (#fff07a). Cell 28 (row 5, column 4) = \"Curse\": Curse nearby enemies: slowed and slowly rotting; dominant colour light green (#7aff8a). Cell 29 (row 5, column 5) = \"Soul Drain\": Rip the life from nearby enemies into yourself; dominant colour green (#5aff7a). Cell 30 (row 5, column 6) = \"Raise Dead\": Raise wraiths from the eaten to fight for you; dominant colour green (#3aff6a). Cell 31 (row 6, column 1) = \"Death Toll\": A toll of doom: massive damage and terror; dominant colour green (#00ff6a). Style: retro 16-bit video game UI asset (SNES / Game Boy Advance era): chunky visible square pixels, no anti-aliasing, no blur, no gradients, flat colour areas with at most 3 shades per colour, clean 1-pixel dark outlines, readable at small size. Background around the tiles: isolated on a perfectly flat solid magenta #FF00FF background (no gradient, no floor, no cast shadow). No text, letters or numbers.",
