␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀Master␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀SFX␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀Master␀␀␀␀␀␀␀RSRC␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀{
  "_note": "Hand-written visual descriptions used by tools/art_prompts.py. Keys are form ids (data/evolutions.json) and creature ids (data/enemies.json).",
  "spawn": "A tiny gumdrop-shaped slime, wider than tall, sitting flat on the ground like a dollop of jelly. Two big round glossy eyes with white highlight dots near the top, and a wide wobbly grin with a row of tiny blunt teeth. Translucent green body with lighter bubbles floating inside and a pale yellow-green shine across the top. No limbs; the bottom edge spreads into a drippy rim.",
  "fang_2": "A small round egg-shaped critter, like a red bean on four stubby clawed feet, with a thin whip-like tail curling behind it. Huge yellow eyes set high on the front of the egg, and an oversized mouth crammed with needle-thin white teeth that takes up half its face. Glossy red skin with a darker maroon belly and a bright yellow shine spot on the top of its head.",
  "fang_3": "A lean, low, lizard-like predator the size of a fox, body stretched long, head thrust forward. Its jaw hinges open unnaturally wide, showing two rows of jagged teeth. Two narrow amber eyes under heavy brows, two short bony spikes on the shoulders, thin muscular legs with hooked claws, and a long tapering tail. Brick-red hide with dark maroon stripes on the back and a pale yellow throat.",
  "fang_4": "A wolf-sized stalking hunter with a low crouching posture. Long narrow skull with four small glowing gold eyes in two rows and a pointed snout with exposed fangs. A short bony crest sweeps back from its brow, three spikes run down its spine, and its long tail ends in a point. Blood-red skin with dark scar-like stripes across the flanks, gold claws.",
  "fang_5": "A big, heavy-shouldered ravager built like a hyena crossed with a raptor. Two curved horns sweep back from a wide skull with four burning gold eyes and a massive underbite full of uneven fangs. Five jagged spikes along a hunched spine, thick forelegs with long hooked claws, scarred crimson hide with near-black patches and bone-white spurs on the elbows.",
  "fang_6a": "A powerful dire-wolf-like beast, lean and muscular, crouched to pounce. Two swept-back horns, a ridge of six dark spikes from neck to tail, and a short ragged crest of red fur on the nape. Two fierce orange eyes, long snout with bared fangs and drool. Deep blood-red fur with near-black legs and back, orange claws and inner mouth.",
  "fang_7a": "A lion-sized beast with a huge shaggy mane soaked dark red framing its face, two horns curving out through the mane. Roaring open mouth with long canines, two blazing orange eyes. Eight spikes run down its back into a long tail tipped with a tuft. Dark crimson body, near-black mane roots fading to blood-red tips, orange claws.",
  "fang_8a": "A hulking, over-muscled six-legged titan, wider than tall, with a broad blocky head. Four horns (two big, two small), four small furious eyes, and a cavernous jaw lined with tusks. Two thick mane crests and eight heavy spikes along a humped back. Very dark red hide over bulging muscles, black armoured knuckles, orange glowing veins on the shoulders.",
  "fang_9a": "A colossal mythic wolf, sleek and noble but terrifying, head lowered in a snarl. Two long horns, a triple crest of flame-like fur along the neck, ten blade spikes down the back, and two long tails flicking behind. Two glowing red eyes, jaws dripping with red light. Near-black fur with deep red undertones and glowing red markings tracing the ribs.",
  "fang_10a": "The apex devourer: a monstrous six-legged king-beast with a crown of four great horns and a three-tier crest like a mane of black flames. Six glowing red eyes, a gaping maw that splits into extra jaws, twelve huge back spikes and two long whipping tails. Pitch-black body with crimson glowing cracks, red-hot claws and fangs.",
  "fang_6b": "A young dragon hatchling with a long body, four legs and two small bat-like wings held half open. Two short horns, a row of four back spikes, two thin tails. Big gold eyes, small snout with a glowing ember inside the mouth. Orange-red scales on top, a purple underbelly and purple wing membranes, gold horn tips.",
  "fang_7b": "A muscular drake, bigger and more armoured, wings spread wider. Overlapping orange-red scales, purple belly plates, a single fin crest on the head, six back spikes, two horns and two tails. Smoke and sparks seep from its nostrils, embers glow in its throat. Gold eyes, gold claws.",
  "fang_8b": "A wyvern lord standing on two strong hind legs, with large wings that double as forelimbs, spread wide in a dominant pose. Long neck, a head with four horns and a double crest, eight spikes along the spine, two barbed tails. Dark red scales, deep purple wing membranes, glowing orange throat and chest.",
  "fang_9b": "An ancient elder dragon with a long, heavy body, four legs and two pairs of tattered wings. Four great horns, four glowing eyes, a double crest, ten spikes and two long tails. Weathered dark-red scales with purple shadows, glowing orange cracks between the scales, a beard of bony spines under the jaw.",
  "fang_10b": "The dragon emperor: a majestic, regal dragon with two pairs of vast wings spread like a cape, four crown-like horns and a three-tier golden crest. Four burning eyes, mouth open with golden fire glowing inside, twelve spikes and three long tails. Deep red-black scales with golden glowing seams, purple-black wing membranes.",
  "stone_2": "A small round pebble-bug with six stubby legs, like a woodlouse made of sandstone. Its back is a lumpy shell of fused grit and pebbles. Two little black beady eyes peeking from under the shell rim and tiny pincer mandibles. Sandy tan stone with darker brown cracks and pale cream speckles.",
  "stone_3": "A beetle-like creature carrying a big domed rock shell on its back like a fortress. Six short sturdy legs, two small horn-like nubs on the shell. Two small eyes and a stubby mandibled mouth under the shell lip. Tan-brown layered stone with darker brown seams and pale gold mineral flecks.",
  "stone_4": "A heavy armadillo-boulder beast on four thick legs, shell made of overlapping rounded rock plates that look able to roll into a ball. One stubby horn on the nose, four stone spikes on the back. Two small determined eyes. Brown stone with dark cracks and glowing amber light seeping from the seams.",
  "stone_5": "A stocky half-beast half-golem standing upright on two thick legs with two big rocky arms and heavy fists. Two curled horns, four stone spikes on the shoulders, a jutting jaw with square teeth. Two glowing amber eyes in a craggy face. Dark brown stone body with moss-free cracks glowing orange.",
  "stone_6a": "A boxy iron-and-stone golem, upright, with massive arms and riveted iron plates bolted onto rock. Two horns, a single crest plate on the head, six spikes on shoulders and back. Two glowing orange eyes in a slit visor, a grille-like mouth. Grey stone, dark iron plates, glowing orange molten veins between plates.",
  "stone_7a": "A walking fortress beast: an upright golem whose shoulders sprout small stone towers with battlements. Four horns, a double crest, eight spikes. Heavy arms like pillars, two glowing orange eyes. Grey stone bricks, near-black iron bands, warm orange glow from arrow-slit windows in the towers.",
  "stone_8a": "A mountain colossus: an enormous upright golem whose back and shoulders are a craggy mountain range with tiny snow caps. Four horns, a double crest of rock, ten jagged peaks as spikes. Two glowing teal eyes, huge boulder fists. Earth-brown stone with grassy patches and glowing teal crystal veins.",
  "stone_9a": "A titan of stone standing tall, cracked ground under its feet. Four teal glowing eyes in a monolithic head, four horns, a triple crest like a crown of standing stones, twelve spikes along its spine. Gigantic arms, runes carved into its chest. Weathered brown-grey stone with glowing teal cracks and runes.",
  "stone_10a": "The world turtle: a gigantic ancient turtle on four pillar legs, its domed shell covered with a miniature landscape of forests, mountains and tiny glowing crystals. Two horns, a triple crest, fourteen spike peaks on the shell rim, short thick tail. Two wise teal-glowing eyes. Mossy green shell, dark brown skin, teal glow.",
  "stone_6b": "A spiked behemoth like a stone-armoured boar-rhino on four legs, head low for charging. Two forward-curving horns, eight thick spikes across its back, short tail. Two small fierce red eyes, tusked mouth. Reddish-brown rock armour, dark maroon skin between plates, red-orange glowing cracks.",
  "stone_7b": "An ankylosaur-like lord: a broad, low, heavily armoured beast on four legs with a wide spiked shell and two tails ending in huge stone clubs. Two horns, one crest, ten spikes along the shell edge. Small fierce eyes. Brown-red stone armour, dark skin, glowing orange-red seams.",
  "stone_8b": "A crag behemoth: an enormous six-legged armoured beast, like a living rock slide, head lowered with four horns in a battering ram. Twelve sharp spikes, two club tails, one crest. Two burning red eyes. Dark reddish-brown boulder armour, dust trailing from its feet, red glowing seams.",
  "stone_9b": "A tarrasque spawn standing upright on two huge legs, with two clawed arms, a reptilian armoured body and a long spiked tail split in two. Four horns, a double crest, fourteen spikes along the back. A huge toothy mouth, two glowing red eyes. Dark brown carapace with red glowing cracks.",
  "stone_10b": "The Tarrasque: a colossal upright reptilian kaiju with an armoured carapace like mountain slabs, four great forward-pointing horns, a triple crest, sixteen spikes and three thick spiked tails. Four glowing red eyes, a gaping fanged maw, massive clawed arms. Near-black brown armour with red-hot glowing cracks.",
  "venom_2": "A small fat grub made of three soft segments, slimy and squishy, head raised. Two big droopy eyes and a round mouth dripping green acid. Lime-green body with darker olive rings between segments and bright yellow-green glowing spots. Its skin is wet and glossy with a few warts; a bubble of acid hangs from its lip and little drops sizzle on the ground. Cute but gross, curious head tilt.",
  "venom_3": "A centipede-like crawler with four segments and six thin legs, low to the ground, head with four small eyes and pincer mandibles dripping goo. Green chitin with dark olive bands, purple glowing toxic sacs along the sides, withered grass bits clinging to it. Its back is covered in bumpy warts and tiny thorns; the purple sacs pulse and leak a thin purple mist. The head is wedge-shaped and low, ready to strike.",
  "venom_4": "A toxic scorpion-crab with a beetle shell, six legs, two big pincer claws held up, and a curled tail with a purple glowing stinger. Four eyes, mandibles. Green shell with dark olive segments and purple venom drops on the claw tips. Its claws are serrated with purple-tipped edges, the shell has bumpy warts and slime streaks, and the stinger drips a purple bead. Aggressive stance with claws raised high.",
  "venom_5": "A plague moth-beetle with a fat armoured body, six legs and four large ragged insect wings shedding purple poison dust. Four eyes, curled proboscis-like jaws, a short stinger tail. Dark green body, olive wing veins, purple glowing spots on the wings. The wings are moth-like with eye-spot patterns, frayed at the edges, and a cloud of purple sparkling dust trails behind. Furry collar around the neck, segmented abdomen with glowing bands.",
  "venom_6a": "A basilisk: a long serpentine lizard with five body segments and four short legs, a frilled crest on the head and four spikes along the spine. Two hypnotic glowing yellow eyes with slit pupils, a mouth with venom fangs. Dark green scales, black underbelly, yellow glowing gaze. The crest is a spiny fan of skin with yellow eye-spots; its scales are small and keeled, venom drips from two long fangs and the grass beside it is shown withered. Low, coiled, menacing pose.",
  "venom_7a": "A three-headed hydra on four squat legs with a heavy body and a thick tail. Each of the three long necks ends in a snake head with two eyes and venom fangs, drool dripping. Six spikes along the back. Deep green scales, dark green belly, yellow-green venom. The three heads look in different directions, each with a small frill; the body is barrel-shaped with thick clawed feet and the back has rows of plate-like scales. Toxic drool pools below.",
  "venom_8a": "A plague hydra: three heads, each sick in a different way (one dripping green, one puffing purple gas, one covered in boils), on a heavy four-legged body with eight spikes and a crest. Swampy olive-green scales, dark underbelly, glowing purple pustules. Its scales are mottled with sickly yellow patches and bubbling sores; the necks are scarred and the crest is ragged. A purple haze hangs around it.",
  "venom_9a": "Nidhogg: a long dark-green serpent dragon with seven body segments, four short clawed legs and two tattered wings, gnawing posture. Two horns, four glowing eyes, ten spikes. Very dark green scales, black shadows, lime-green glowing venom dripping from its jaws. Its jaws are oversized for gnawing roots, its wings are ragged and leaf-like, and twisted roots and vines are wrapped around its body. Coiled, ancient, hunched pose.",
  "venom_10a": "The Mother of Plagues: a huge six-legged hydra matriarch with five serpent heads on long necks, a bloated glowing egg-sac belly, twelve spikes and a double crest. Dark swamp-green scales, near-black shadows, magenta-purple glowing poison sacs and drool. Each head wears a different frill, her back has rows of glowing egg sacs and her six legs are short and powerful. A crown-like double crest on the central head, venom streams from all five mouths.",
  "venom_6b": "A brood spider: a round fat spider body on eight long jointed legs, six small glowing eyes on its face, fangs. Dark olive-brown chitin with a green glowing hourglass mark on the abdomen and strands of web trailing behind. Its legs are long, bristly and banded, the six eyes sit in two rows on a small head, and its fangs drip green venom. A plump, pear-shaped abdomen dominates the silhouette.",
  "venom_7b": "A scorpion knight: a large scorpion with eight legs and two huge armoured pincers, its tail ending in a lance-like stinger. Chitin plates shaped like knight armour with four spikes, four eyes behind a visor-like head plate. Bronze-brown chitin, dark joints, bright green venom tip. Its claws look like a knight's gauntlets, the head has a helmet plume crest, and the stinger is long and straight like a jousting lance. Proud, armoured, upright pose.",
  "venom_8b": "A chitin queen: a huge round-bodied spider queen on eight legs, with a crown crest, six spikes and a short tail, tiny spiderlings crawling on her back. Six glowing eyes. Dark brown-black chitin with glowing green markings. Her abdomen is enormous and swollen with glowing green eggs, her legs are long and spiny, and she wears a jagged chitin crown. Several tiny spiderlings cling to her legs.",
  "venom_9b": "Arachne Matriarch: a humanoid upper body with two clawed arms rising from the front of a giant spider body with eight legs. Two horns, a double crest, six spikes, six glowing eyes. Black-brown chitin, dark joints, glowing mint-green markings. Her upper body is armoured like a queen with spiked shoulder plates; her spider legs are long and spiny; her face has six eyes in a crown pattern and mandibles at the mouth.",
  "venom_10b": "The Hive Empress: a towering insect-spider queen with an upright torso, four clawed arms, eight legs, two pairs of translucent insect wings, two horns and a triple crown crest. Eight glowing eyes. Glossy black chitin with glowing aqua-green veins. Her wings shimmer with a green sheen, her four arms hold up in a commanding pose, and a glowing hive-heart pulses in her chest. A tall, regal, insectoid silhouette.",
  "arcane_2": "A small floating jellyfish creature with one big glowing eye in the middle of its dome and four short wavy tentacles. Translucent blue body with a darker navy core, cyan sparkles drifting around it. Its single eye is huge, with a starry pupil; tiny runic symbols float around it and the tentacles curl gently. Very cute, small, bobbing in the air.",
  "arcane_3": "A bigger floating jelly with three eyes and a small toothy mouth, six trailing tentacles that end in glowing tips. Translucent royal-blue dome with a navy inner swirl, pale cyan glow and wisps of light being sucked into its mouth. The three eyes are arranged in a triangle, its mouth has tiny glowing teeth, and its tentacles are long and ribbon-like with glowing tips. Looks hungry for light.",
  "arcane_4": "A round egg-bodied creature on four slender legs with a thin tail, three eyes and a small crest. Glowing cyan runes crawl over deep blue skin; a darker navy belly. Small magic sparks float around it. Its eyes are arranged in a vertical row, its crest is a thin fin covered in glowing glyphs, and its feet are small and dainty. Runes glow along its tail.",
  "arcane_5": "A rune-covered egg-bodied beast with a huge mouth full of glowing runes instead of a tongue, five eyes arranged in an arc, two small horns and a double crest. Four legs, a tail. Deep blue body, navy shadows, bright cyan glowing glyphs. Its mouth opens like a book showing glowing letters; small rune circles orbit its horns, and its five eyes glow. Floating sparks surround it.",
  "arcane_6a": "An eldritch seer: a floating round body covered in seven eyes of different sizes, six tentacles hanging below, a small mouth, one crest. Dark indigo body with a starfield pattern, glowing cyan irises. Its eyes look in all directions; a halo-like crest floats above it, and its tentacles are slender with glowing tips. Small magic circles float around it.",
  "arcane_7a": "An astral beholder: a large floating sphere dominated by one huge central eye, with eight eye-stalks/tentacles each tipped with a small eye, two horns and a toothy grin. Violet-indigo body, dark navy shadows, glowing pink irises. Its central eye has a glowing pink iris and a slit pupil, the eye stalks curl like snakes, and its horns are crescent-shaped. A wide grin of pointed teeth sits below the central eye.",
  "arcane_8a": "A void archon: a robed humanoid shape floating without legs, four arms, six tentacles trailing below like a cloak, two horns and a double crest like a halo. Three glowing eyes. Deep indigo body, black shadows, lavender glowing runes. Its body looks like a floating cloak of dark space, its four arms gesture as if casting, and space warps around its halo crest. Floating debris orbits it.",
  "arcane_9a": "A star leviathan: a long cosmic sea-serpent with eight body segments and four fin-like wings, a triple crest and six fins/spikes. Four glowing eyes, toothy jaw. Midnight-blue body full of tiny stars and constellation lines, glowing yellow-white highlights. Its body is translucent like a night sky, its wing-fins trail like comet tails, and its crest is shaped like a crown of stars. It swims through the air in a graceful curve.",
  "arcane_10a": "The Cosmic Ascendant: a radiant floating sphere of eyes (eleven eyes of many sizes), with ten tentacles of light, two pairs of luminous wings, four horns and a triple halo crest. Deep space-black-indigo body, white glowing eyes and edges. Its wings are made of light, its halo crest floats in three rings, and its tentacles end in tiny stars. Looks like a god of the cosmos.",
  "arcane_6b": "A hexbloom: a floating jelly-flower creature with a cursed bloom on top, eight vine-like tentacles hanging below, two eyes and a toothy mouth, double petal crest. Dark purple body, near-black shadows, glowing poison-green spots and petal edges. The bloom on its head has dark purple petals with glowing green veins; its tentacles are thorny vines; tiny skulls dangle from the vines like fruits.",
  "arcane_7b": "A wraithmaw: a ghostly upper body with two clawed arms and no legs, trailing four smoky tentacles, two horns. A huge mouth sucking in green soul wisps, two glowing eyes. Dark purple robes of smoke, near-black shadows, green soul-fire. Its jaw unhinges like a snake's, its arms are long and thin with claw fingers, and its horns curl like a ram's. Green souls swirl into its mouth.",
  "arcane_8b": "A lich beast: a skeletal upright beast on two legs with two arms, four horns, a double crest and four bone spikes; ribs showing, glowing green heart missing (an empty cage). Two glowing green eyes. Dark mauve bone and rotten hide, black shadows, green soul-fire. A small glowing green soul jar hangs from a chain around its neck; its horns are long and cracked, and tattered robes hang from its shoulders.",
  "arcane_9b": "A soul reaver: a tall skeletal demon on two legs with four arms ending in scythe claws, two tattered wings, four horns, a triple crest and six spikes. Two glowing green eyes. Dark purple-black body, green soul-fire wisps. Its scythe claws glow green; its wings are skeletal with torn membranes; a hood of shadow hangs over its skull face.",
  "arcane_10b": "The Death Sovereign: a regal skeletal lich-king on two legs with four arms, two pairs of tattered wings, four ghostly tentacles, four horns and a triple bone crown. Three glowing green eyes, a royal cape. Black-purple body, bright green soul-fire. Its crown is made of glowing green bone spires, its cape is ragged and floating, and souls swirl around it. Its four arms hold a scythe, a staff and green flames.",
  "glow_mote": "A tiny floating light-jelly no bigger than a firefly swarm: a soft round dome with one big curious eye in the centre and three short wispy tentacles dangling below. Sky-blue translucent body with a darker blue core, a pale cyan glow around the rim and a few sparkles orbiting it. Gentle and harmless looking.",
  "shell_mite": "A tiny timid mite with a smooth tan dome shell like a lentil, six thin scuttling legs and two beady black eyes peeking out from under the front lip. Light brown shell with darker brown edge rings and a cream highlight on top. Nervous, ready-to-run posture.",
  "biter_larva": "A small chubby red larva of three soft segments, front end reared up, with two little angry eyes and a round mouth ringed by tiny sharp teeth. Coral-red body, dark maroon rings between segments, peach-coloured belly and mouth.",
  "spore_swarm": "A puffball spore: a small lime-green fuzzy sphere with one sleepy eye, covered in tiny bumps and trailing a few floating spores. Bright lime body, olive shadow underneath, pale yellow spore specks. Its fuzz is like dandelion seeds, and tiny glowing spores drift away from it.",
  "pool_matriarch": "A big ancient slime mother: a huge teal gelatinous blob with three eyes, a wide mouth with soft teeth and six thick tentacles spreading over the ground. Inside her translucent body float smaller baby slimes and bubbles. Teal-green body, dark teal shadows, glowing yellow-green spots and rim.",
  "puff_cap": "A walking mushroom: a round pink-magenta cap with white spots on a short cream stem with two stubby feet and two cute dot eyes on the stem. Puffs of spores drift from under the cap. Rose-pink cap, off-white stem, white spots.",
  "bog_leech": "A slimy bog leech: a dark, glistening four-segment worm with no eyes, front end raised, a round sucker mouth full of tiny red teeth. Very dark brown-black body with a wet shine, a red glowing ring inside the mouth.",
  "lantern_moth": "A plump egg-bodied moth with four broad wings, two big dark eyes and fuzzy antennae; its abdomen glows like a paper lantern. Warm yellow body and wings with brown wing patterns, a soft pale-yellow glowing belly.",
  "mire_crab": "A muddy swamp crab with a wide flat shell, six walking legs and two big uneven pincers raised defensively, two eyes on stalks. Mud-brown shell with darker cracks and moss, orange-tipped claws. Its shell is covered in mud and reeds, one claw is much bigger than the other, and bubbles rise from its mouth.",
  "gnat_cloud": "A small round fuzzy gnat with one compound eye and two buzzing transparent wings, drawn as a tight little cluster of three or four identical gnats. Olive-green bodies, dark legs, lime highlights on the wings.",
  "mycelium_lord": "A towering mushroom lord: a huge purple mushroom cap like a crown, a thick cream stem with a face of four glowing eyes and a gaping fungal mouth, six root-tentacles spreading at the base. Purple cap with pale spots, cream stem, glowing lime spores and gills.",
  "thorn_hare": "A skittish hare-like creature with an egg-shaped body, four springy legs and two long antler-like horns in place of ears, four thorny spikes along its back. Two big alert eyes. Light brown fur, dark brown back, leafy green thorn tips.",
  "vine_snapper": "A carnivorous plant: a bulbous green pod on a short stem with a huge Venus-flytrap mouth, no eyes, and six whipping vine tentacles around the base. Green leaves with dark green veins, pink-red inner mouth with thorny teeth.",
  "dusk_wolfling": "A small lean wolf cub with a long body, four legs, a bushy tail and pointed ears, snarling with tiny fangs. Two glowing yellow eyes. Slate-blue-grey fur, dark navy back, yellow eye glow. Its ears are big for its head, its paws are oversized, and its tail is fluffy. A snarling puppy.",
  "wisp_sprite": "A floating ghost-light sprite: a teardrop-shaped jelly body with two big glowing eyes, three ribbon-like tail tentacles. Mint-teal body, dark teal core, white glowing aura and sparkles. Its body is see-through with a bright heart of light inside, its eyes are big and friendly, and tiny sparkles trail behind it.",
  "bark_behemoth": "A huge upright tree-golem: a trunk body on two root legs with two massive branch arms, four antler-like branch horns and six thorny spikes; a face carved in the bark with two glowing green eyes and a jagged mouth. Dark brown bark, darker cracks, glowing lime-green moss and sap.",
  "dune_skink": "A small sand lizard with a long slim body, four splayed legs, a long tail and a pointed snout, two bright eyes. Sandy-orange scales with dark brown stripes, an orange-red tail tip. Quick, darting pose.",
  "bone_scarab": "A beetle with a shell made of bleached bone, six legs, two small eyes and a little skull-like pattern on the shell. Off-white bone with grey shadows, dark brown legs and joints. Its shell has a rib-like pattern and a small skull motif in the centre; its legs are bony and thin.",
  "sand_lurker": "An ambush predator rising from the sand: a long body with six legs, two horns, four spikes and four red eyes, a wide jaw full of teeth. Sandy-tan hide with dark brown stripes, glowing red eyes and mouth.",
  "dust_wraith": "A wraith made of swirling dust: a hooded jelly-like ghost body with three glowing eyes and four ragged dust tentacles trailing behind. Dusty beige body, brown shadows, pale yellow glowing eyes. Its body is shaped like a swirling cloak of sand, small stones orbit it, and its three eyes are in a triangle.",
  "sting_tail": "A desert scorpion with eight legs, two pincers and a curled tail ending in a glowing green stinger, two eyes. Amber-brown chitin with dark brown joints, lime-green venom. Its shell is ridged and sun-bleached, its claws are broad and serrated, and the stinger drips green venom. Tail curled high over its back.",
  "ossuary_wyrm": "A giant bone wyrm: a serpent of eight vertebra-like segments with ten rib spikes, a horned skull head with four horns, four glowing red eyes and a jaw of jagged teeth. Bone-white body, grey-brown shadows, red-orange glow inside the skull and between bones.",
  "shard_beetle": "A crystal beetle with a slate-blue shell, six legs, two eyes and three pale cyan crystal shards growing from its back. Steel-blue shell, dark navy legs, glowing cyan crystals. Its shell is polished and faceted like a gemstone, its legs are short and thin, and its eyes are small and black.",
  "echo_bat": "A round fuzzy bat with two big leathery wings, two eyes, big ears and an open mouth with tiny fangs. Dark purple fur, black wing membranes, pink inner ears and mouth. Its ears are enormous, sound-wave rings are faintly visible around it, and its tiny feet hang below its round body.",
  "prism_slug": "A crystal slug with three soft segments, two eye stalks and four prism crystals on its back that refract rainbow light. Lilac-purple body, dark purple shadows, glowing cyan crystals. A slimy rainbow trail lies behind it; its crystals are clear with rainbow highlights, and its eyes are on long stalks. Slow, gentle pose.",
  "geode_golem": "A stocky golem made of a cracked-open geode: two legs, two arms, one glowing eye, five purple crystal clusters growing out of its back and shoulders. Grey stone outside, purple glowing crystals inside the cracks.",
  "crystal_queen": "A regal crystal monarch: an upright body on six crystal legs with two graceful arms, a towering triple crown crest of crystals and eight crystal spires. Three glowing eyes. Periwinkle-blue crystal body, navy shadows, white glowing highlights.",
  "ruin_eel": "A long sea eel with six segments, two side fins, two glowing eyes and a toothy jaw, with ancient carved stone patterns on its skin. Dark teal body, near-black shadows, yellow glowing markings.",
  "drowned_knight": "A drowned undead knight: an upright figure in barnacle-crusted armour with two legs, two arms, a horned helmet with two horns and a seaweed plume crest, two glowing eyes in the visor. Teal-grey armour, dark teal shadows, mint-green glow.",
  "jelly_drifter": "A drifting jellyfish with a large translucent bell, no eyes and six long frilly tentacles. Pink-violet body, dark purple inner organs, glowing pale pink edges. Its bell is see-through with glowing pink veins, and the frilly tentacles trail long and wavy beneath it. It drifts calmly, bobbing in place.",
  "siren_fry": "A small fish with an egg-shaped body, two fins, a fanned tail and two big eyes. Sky-blue scales, dark blue back, pale yellow belly and fin edges. Its fins are long and flowing like ribbons, the scales sparkle, and a small glowing yellow lure hangs from its forehead.",
  "coral_horde": "A small round coral creature with four little legs, two eyes and five branching coral spikes on its back. Coral-pink body, dark red shadows, cream tips. Its little body is knobbly like real coral with tiny polyps, its legs are short crab-like stubs, and it looks small but feisty. Drawn as one creature.",
  "tide_kraken": "A giant kraken: a bulbous round head-body with two huge eyes, a beak-like toothy mouth and ten thick tentacles spreading out. Deep maroon-plum skin, near-black shadows, glowing yellow suckers and eyes. Its tentacles are thick and curl dramatically, its skin is spotted with barnacles, and its eyes glow yellow. A small crown of coral sits on its head.",
  "cinder_imp": "A small fiery imp standing on two legs with two clawed arms, two small horns and two bat wings, a cheeky grin. Charcoal-black body with glowing orange cracks, a flame flickering on its head.",
  "magma_tortoise": "A slow tortoise on four stumpy legs with a short tail, its shell made of cooled lava rock with three glowing magma vents. Two sleepy eyes. Dark charcoal shell, black skin, glowing orange magma.",
  "ash_hound": "A lean hound of ash and embers: long body, four legs, a tail, four back spikes, two glowing eyes and a fanged jaw. Ash-grey fur, black shadows, orange glowing embers in its mouth and cracks.",
  "sulfur_spitter": "A squat mushroom-shaped vent creature with a yellow sulfur cap, two eyes and a mouth that spits yellow-orange gas. Mustard-yellow cap, dark olive shadows, orange glow. Yellow crystal crust covers the cap, a wide mouth puckers like a vent, and wisps of yellow gas rise from small holes in the cap.",
  "ember_tyrant": "A volcanic dragon tyrant: a long four-legged body, two pairs of fiery wings, four horns, eight spikes and two tails. Two blazing eyes and a mouth full of fire. Dark red-brown scales, near-black shadows, golden-orange glowing cracks and flames.",
  "snow_lynx": "A graceful white lynx with a long body, four legs, a fluffy tail and tufted ears, two pale blue eyes. White fur, grey-blue shadows, ice-blue accents on the ear tips and tail. Its ear tufts are long, its fur is fluffy, and its paws are big and soft. A light, quick pose.",
  "ice_mammoth": "A woolly ice mammoth: a heavy body on four thick legs, two long curved tusks, shaggy brown fur, a short tail and small eyes. Brown fur, dark brown shadows, icy blue frost on the tusks and back.",
  "frost_wraith": "A hovering frost wraith: a ghostly jelly-like hooded body with two glowing eyes, five icy trailing tentacles and three ice crystals floating around it. Pale blue body, dark blue shadows, white glow. Its body is a tattered cloak of frost, its tentacles are icy and jagged, and its eyes glow cold white.",
  "rime_wolf": "A frost wolf with a long body, four legs, a bushy tail and a shaggy icy mane, two glowing cyan eyes and a fanged jaw. Silver-blue fur, dark grey-blue shadows, glowing cyan frost.",
  "glacier_crawler": "A glacier crawler: an armoured eight-legged beetle with four eyes, a mandibled jaw and five ice crystals jutting from its shell. Ice-blue shell, dark navy shadows, white glowing crystals. Its legs are long and spiky like icicles, its four eyes glow white, and frost mist curls around it. The body is low and wide.",
  "rime_colossus": "A huge frost giant: an upright body on two legs with two massive arms, four icy horns, a shaggy white fur mantle, six ice crystal spikes, two glowing cyan eyes and a toothy jaw. White-blue body, slate-blue shadows, cyan glow.",
  "thunder_roc": "A giant storm bird: an egg-shaped body on two taloned legs, two massive wings, a double feather crest, two eyes and a hooked beak. Deep blue feathers, dark navy shadows, crackling yellow lightning glow.",
  "cloud_ray": "A manta ray made of cloud, drifting through the sky: a wide egg-shaped body, two broad wing fins, a long thin tail and two gentle eyes. White-lavender body, grey-blue shadows, sky-blue highlights. Its body is soft and puffy with cloudy edges; its tail is thin and trails wisps of cloud.",
  "spark_swarm": "A crackling spark ball: a small bright yellow sphere with one eye and four zigzag lightning spikes. Bright yellow body, dark gold shadows, white electric glow. Small electric arcs jump between its spikes, its one eye is a bright white dot, and the body crackles with energy. Small and hyperactive.",
  "gale_harpy": "A harpy: an upright figure on two taloned legs with two big feathered wings for arms, a feather crest, two sharp eyes and a beaked mouth. Olive-green feathers, dark green shadows, lime highlights.",
  "storm_serpent": "A storm serpent dragon: a long nine-segment serpent with two pairs of wings, two horns, a triple crest, two glowing eyes and a toothy jaw. Deep blue scales, navy shadows, yellow lightning markings along its body.",
  "void_mite": "A small round void mite with six thin legs and one glowing eye, its shell like a hole into space. Dark indigo body, black shadows, glowing lilac rim and eye. Its legs are thin and jagged, its shell is speckled with tiny stars, and its eye glows like a distant star.",
  "abyss_stalker": "An abyss stalker: a long six-legged predator with six glowing eyes, a fanged jaw, a tail and six spikes. Near-black body, black shadows, glowing pink-red eyes and markings. Its legs are long, thin and spider-like, its eyes are arranged in two rows, its spikes are jagged black shards, and its body is low and slinking.",
  "dread_maw": "A dread maw: a blob creature that is mostly an enormous mouth full of fangs, no eyes, four horns and six tentacles. Dark plum-black body, black shadows, glowing green drool. Its mouth is so wide it takes up the whole body, its fangs are uneven and long, and its tentacles end in hooks. Drool drips to the ground.",
  "null_shell": "A null shell: a beetle with a smooth grey-black shell, four legs, two eyes and four violet crystal shards. Dark grey shell, black shadows, glowing lavender crystals. Its shell is smooth as polished obsidian and reflects faint stars; the violet crystals stick up like antennae; its legs are short and thick.",
  "gazer": "A gazer: a floating round body with five eyes (one large central eye), five tentacles hanging below and a toothy mouth. Dark plum body, black shadows, glowing magenta-pink eyes. Its tentacles end in smaller eyes, its central eye has a slit pupil, and its teeth are thin and needle-like. It hovers with an eerie stare.",
  "rift_warden": "The rift warden: a floating robed figure with four arms and no legs, eight tentacles trailing beneath, four horns and a triple crest like a halo, three glowing eyes and a jaw. Dark indigo body, black shadows, glowing magenta runes.",
  "primeval_devourer": "An enormous blob of darkness with three heads, nine eyes, a gaping central maw, twelve tentacles, four horns, sixteen spikes, two pairs of wings and a triple crest. Very dark crimson-black body, black shadows, glowing magenta-red cracks and eyes."
}
